Topic 1: Describe a time when you were ill

I would like to talk about a time when I was ill.Last year, I caught a cold and had a high fever. I also had a headache, a sore throat, and a runny nose. I felt very tired and couldn't concentrate on anything.I was ill for about four days. During that time, I stayed at home, took some medicine, and drank a lot of water. My mother also cooked some healthy meals for me and reminded me to get enough sleep.Because I was sick, I couldn't go to school or meet my friends. I also missed some important lessons, so I had to study harder after I recovered.It was an unpleasant experience, but it taught me to take better care of my health. Since then, I have tried to eat healthy food and exercise regularly.

Topic 2:Describe a famous person that you would like to meet

I would like to talk about a famous person I would like to meet. His name is Cristiano Ronaldo. He is a famous Portuguese football player.He is well-known for his football skills, speed, and hard work. He has played for many famous football clubs and won many important awards.I want to meet him because I really admire his talent and determination. He always works hard to improve himself and never gives up, even when he faces difficulties.If I had a chance to meet him, I would ask him how he stays motivated and practices every day. I would also like to take a photo with him.I think meeting him would be an unforgettable experience. He inspires me to work harder and follow my dreams.

Topic 47: Describe a success that you were proud of

I would like to talk about a success that made me very proud. It was completing a difficult project at university.At first, I found the project quite challenging because I didn't have enough experience. To complete it, I spent a lot of time searching for information, learning new skills, and working with my teammates.During the project, we had some problems with our code. Sometimes, we didn't know how to solve them. However, we didn't give up. We discussed the problems and tried different ways to fix them.Finally, we finished the project on time and received good feedback from our teacher.I felt very happy and proud because I had learned many useful things and improved my teamwork skills.This experience taught me that if I work hard and stay patient, I can achieve my goals.

Topic 48: Describe a bad service you had at a shop or a restaurant

I would like to talk about a bad experience I had at a restaurant.A few months ago, I went to a restaurant with some of my friends. We ordered several dishes and waited for about 40 minutes. However, when the food arrived, the staff brought us the wrong dishes.We told them about the mistake, but they didn't seem interested in helping us. They were also quite unfriendly, so we felt disappointed and uncomfortable.After that, I decided to talk to the manager. Luckily, he listened to our problem and asked the staff to bring us the correct dishes. He also apologized for the mistake.Although the problem was finally solved, I didn't enjoy the experience very much.I think good customer service is very important because it makes customers feel comfortable and want to come back.

Topic 49: Describe an outdoor sport you would like to try

I would like to talk about an outdoor sport I would like to try. It is hiking.I first became interested in this activity after watching some videos on social media. I saw many people walking up mountains and enjoying beautiful views of nature.I think hiking can be quite difficult because people need to walk long distances and climb steep paths. They also need to prepare enough food, water, and suitable clothes.I want to try hiking because I enjoy outdoor activities and want to challenge myself. I think it is also a good way to stay healthy, relax, and reduce stress after studying.In the future, I hope I can go hiking with my friends during a holiday. I believe it will be a fun and unforgettable experience.

Topic 50: Describe an interesting video that you watched on social media

I would like to talk about an interesting video I watched on social media.I watched it about two weeks ago on TikTok. The video was about Ludwig van Beethoven, a famous German composer.In the video, I learned more about his life and his music. The most interesting thing was that he lost his hearing but continued to compose music. I was really surprised because I thought it was almost impossible to make music without hearing it.The video also showed some of his famous musical works. After watching it, I searched for more information about him and listened to some of his music.I found the video very interesting because it taught me something new. It also reminded me that we should never give up when facing difficulties.